{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/NEXT-GEN_RC_RACING.png?t=1753550844\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/CinematicRace.gif?t=1753550844\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience RC racing like never before in Recharge, a true sim-cade game that blends arcade fun with simulation-inspired handling. Enjoy realistic physics, impressive graphics and deep customization options. Race solo or with friends across diverse tracks, from professional RC circuits to real-world inspired environments. With broad controller support, including RC-style controllers and gamepads, Recharge delivers a dynamic and authentic RC racing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/SINGLEPLAYER___MULTIPLAYER.png?t=1753550844\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/GameplayRace.gif?t=1753550844\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recharge caters to both solo racers and competitive spirits, offering an experience that suits your preferred playstyle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In singleplayer, face AI opponents at different difficulty levels or challenge your ghost to improve your best times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer supports up to 12 players in online races, with private lobbies for friends or public lobbies for wider competition.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each mode brings intense racing action, whether you\u2019re honing your skills alone or battling it out with others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/CUSTOMIZATION.png?t=1753550844\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/Customization.gif?t=1753550844\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recharge lets you build an RC car that feels uniquely yours, blending performance upgrades with personalized style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your car\u2019s performance by upgrading the motor, ESC and chassis to meet any challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize the look with paint, stickers and body choices, creating a distinctive appearance on the track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the perfect balance of speed, control and style that matches how you want to.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/DIVERSE_TRACKS.png?t=1753550844\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/Maps.gif?t=1753550844\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recharge offers a wide variety of tracks, each crafted to deliver a distinct RC racing experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race in professional RC circuits inspired by real professional tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the action to the beach, amusement parks and skateparks, bringing the thrill of real-world locations into the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each track challenges you in a unique way, offering fresh racing experiences that keep you coming back for more.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3225420?t=1753550844","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3225420?t=1753550844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/ce73fd4b81de55d8a08a5ef9c378587ddfbcf97a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753550844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/ce73fd4b81de55d8a08a5ef9c378587ddfbcf97a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753550844","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap (Open in new tab to see in full resolution))</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/a86a29c56c885d5c982c9ce3bac70dd7.avif?t=1753550844\" data-has-big /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/NEXT-GEN_RC_RACING.png?t=1753550844\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/CinematicRace.gif?t=1753550844\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience RC racing like never before in Recharge, a true sim-cade game that blends arcade fun with simulation-inspired handling. Enjoy realistic physics, impressive graphics and deep customization options. Race solo or with friends across diverse tracks, from professional RC circuits to real-world inspired environments. With broad controller support, including RC-style controllers and gamepads, Recharge delivers a dynamic and authentic RC racing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/SINGLEPLAYER___MULTIPLAYER.png?t=1753550844\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/GameplayRace.gif?t=1753550844\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recharge caters to both solo racers and competitive spirits, offering an experience that suits your preferred playstyle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In singleplayer, face AI opponents at different difficulty levels or challenge your ghost to improve your best times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer supports up to 12 players in online races, with private lobbies for friends or public lobbies for wider competition.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each mode brings intense racing action, whether you\u2019re honing your skills alone or battling it out with others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/CUSTOMIZATION.png?t=1753550844\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/Customization.gif?t=1753550844\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recharge lets you build an RC car that feels uniquely yours, blending performance upgrades with personalized style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your car\u2019s performance by upgrading the motor, ESC and chassis to meet any challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize the look with paint, stickers and body choices, creating a distinctive appearance on the track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the perfect balance of speed, control and style that matches how you want to.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/DIVERSE_TRACKS.png?t=1753550844\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/Maps.gif?t=1753550844\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recharge offers a wide variety of tracks, each crafted to deliver a distinct RC racing experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race in professional RC circuits inspired by real professional tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the action to the beach, amusement parks and skateparks, bringing the thrill of real-world locations into the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each track challenges you in a unique way, offering fresh racing experiences that keep you coming back for more.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Room Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/fbc4b93083e4a5442a699753859f74a4da30e6c7/header.jpg?t=1753550844","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257162558,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162558/movie480.mp4?t=1751060699","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162558/movie_max.mp4?t=1751060699"},"name":"Recharge - Early Access Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257162558/cb8bc42b924fb5b2dbec7393ae9a413f3f8cea9f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751060699","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162558/movie480